  "offlineOnly": true,
  "offlineNote": "Single-player only. Use mods only in a solo, offline game: in multiplayer they spoil the contract for everyone else and can get your account banned. The ghost identifier, Library, timers and overlay never touch the game and are fine anywhere.",
  "info": [
    {
      "title": "Ghost identifier",
      "body": "Library, Ghost identifier: tap each piece of evidence as you find it or rule it out, and the list narrows to the ghosts that fit. Works from your phone too."
    },
    {
      "title": "Evidence by difficulty",
      "body": "Up to Professional the ghost gives 3 pieces of evidence, Nightmare 2, Insanity 1. Set this in the identifier so it doesn't rule out the right ghost."
    },
    {
      "title": "Incense",
      "body": "Lit near the ghost, incense stops it starting a hunt for 90 seconds (Spirit 180, Demon 60). The timer presets start one from your phone."
    }
  ],
